+        "fat subspace of GF(2^128)^s given by an ordered GF(2)-basis",
+        "matrix over GF(2^128)",
+        "determinant orbit invariant as a polynomial over GF(2)",
+    ],
+    "verification_operations": [
+        "exact polynomial-basis arithmetic in GF(2^128)",
